# Charting Library
# TradingView's charting library is licensed per site and never committed; a licensee drops
# its own copy at tradingview/tradingview.tgz and postinstall extracts it.
tradingview/tradingview.tgz
public/tradingview/*
public/datafeed
# Don't ignore custom styling
!public/tradingview/custom-styles.css 
!public/tradingview/colors.css
!public/tradingview/custom-styles-deprecated.css 
!public/tradingview/colors-deprecated.css

